fications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IvanDaniliuk01/hospital-tpi/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IvanDaniliuk01/hospital-tpi/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IvanDaniliuk01/hospital-tpi/deployments","created_at":"2026-10-05T17:33:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T17:33:31Z","pushed_at":"2026-10-05T17:35:01Z","git_url":"git://github.com/IvanDaniliuk01/hospital-tpi.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:IvanDaniliuk01/hospital-tpi.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/IvanDaniliuk01/hospital-tpi.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/IvanDaniliuk01/hospital-tpi","homepage":null,"size":0,"stargazers_count":0,"watchers_count":0,"language":"HTML","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":0,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":3,"license":null,"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":0,"open_issues":3,"watchers":0,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":true,"maintain":true,"push":true,"triage":true,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IvanDaniliuk01/hospital-tpi/pulls/3","html_url":"https://github.com/IvanDaniliuk01/hospital-tpi/pull/3","diff_url":"https://github.com/IvanDaniliuk01/hospital-tpi/pull/3.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/IvanDaniliuk01/hospital-tpi/pull/3.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## Issue\nCloses #1\nRefs #2 (se entrega el diagnóstico y la estrategia; el Issue sigue abierto)\n\n## Qué cambia\n- **Tooling de calidad en el `pom.xml`:** Spotless 2.44.4 + google-java-format 1.35.0, Checkstyle 10.21.4 (perfil DoD en `config/checkstyle`), PMD 7.7 + CPD (ruleset DoD en `config/pmd`), versions-maven-plugin. Todos atados a `verify`, así que `mvn verify` es la compuerta completa.\n- **Formato:** `spotless:apply` sobre 23 archivos (solo cambios de formato; las 137 pruebas siguen en verde). El paquete `legacy` queda excluido para conservar los originales de TP1/TP3.\n- **Hooks versionados (`.githooks/`):** `pre-commit` secuencial formatter → linter → pruebas, que corta en el primer fallo y aborta el commit. `pre-push` que rechaza el push a `main` y corre `mvn clean verify`.\n- **DoD v2.0:** los criterios verificables por máquina pasan a ejecutarse en los hooks, y se agrega C8 (seguridad de dependencias).\n- **Auditoría estática** del módulo heredado (`auditoria-legacy/`, `docs/AUDITORIA_ESTATICA.md`) e **Informe de Calidad en Verde** (`docs/INFORME_CALIDAD_VERDE.md`).\n\n## Checklist de la Definition of Done (v2.0)\n- [x] C1 Compilación sin warnings (pre-commit 2/3): `-Xlint:all -Werror` OK\n- [x] C2 Pruebas en verde (pre-commit 3/3): 137/137\n- [x] C3 Cobertura (pre-push): 97,97 % líneas · 100 % ramas\n- [ ] C4 Aprobación de al menos un par, sin comentarios Altos abiertos: **pendiente (revisor)**\n- [x] C5 Formatter + Checkstyle + PMD + CPD: 0 / 0 / 0 / 0\n- [x] C6 Javadoc / documentación: DoD v2.0, README, auditoría, informe\n- [x] C7 Calidad interna de las pruebas: sin cambios de lógica en las pruebas\n- [x] C8 Dependencias: OSV-Scanner, 0 vulnerabilidades\n\n## Evidencias\n- Logs del pre-commit (rechazos A/B/C y corridas en verde): `evidencias/semana3/precommit/`\n- Compuerta completa: `evidencias/semana3/compuerta/` (Surefire, JaCoCo, Checkstyle, PMD, CPD)\n- Auditoría: `evidencias/semana3/auditoria/` (PMD, CPD, Checkstyle, versions, dependency:tree, OSV)\n- Bypass (`--no-verify` → pre-push → protección de `main`): `evidencias/semana3/precommit/bypass/`\n\n## Cómo probarlo\n```\ngit switch feature/1-compuerta-calidad-precommit\ngit config core.hooksPath .githooks\nmvn clean verify\n```\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IvanDaniliuk01/hospital-tpi/issues/3/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"